                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='573' forceUpdate='true' h='64556' id='21' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='98770' x='615' y='17222'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='11'>The dashboard quantifies the full cost of processing payments by</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='11'>measuring the costs for all payment methods, regardless of type, source of funds and detailed categories. Its goal is to create a metric for cost within DH for all fintech initiatives</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='11'>Online Payment Costs </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='11'>include all fees associated with the processing, clearing and settlement of online payments invoiced to the entity by external providers. Depending on the pricing model and contract, it can include gateway, acquiring, tokenisation and other fees.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='11'>Cash Collection Costs </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='11'>include all fees associated with the collection of cash payments invoiced to the entity by external providers. Comprised of:</run>
                  <run lmargin='420'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='11' lmargin='420'>Gateway fee: use of Ixopay as a connector with a wide array of external providers</run>
                  <run lmargin='420'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='11' lmargin='420'>Collection fee: charged by the bank or network for the deposit of cash and remittance to DH</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='10'>*The cost is meassured only for Own Delivery (OD) orders in countries that use the cash collection automation offered by Fintech, therefore orders delivered through 3rd party logistics or by the restaurants are not included.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='11'>Fraud Costs </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='11'>include all fees associated with the risk management and losses due to fraudulent activity. Comprised of:</run>
                  <run lmargin='420'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='11' lmargin='420'>Fraud prevention: use of tools (internal or external) to mitigate fraud</run>
                  <run lmargin='420'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='11' lmargin='420'>Fraud Loss: losses incurred due to fraudulent activity</run>
                  <run lmargin='420'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='11' lmargin='420'>BAU wastage</run>
                  <run lmargin='420'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='11'>Tech Costs </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='11'>include fees associated with the operation and maintenance of the Fintech Central layer. Comprised of:</run>
                  <run lmargin='420'>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='11' lmargin='420'>Server costs provided by AWS, Google Cloud, etc.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='10'>*Since many tech resources are shared across multiple regions, costs on a regional basis are calculated by using the # of successful orders as a proxy. For instance, if Foodpanda APAC processed 40% of the successful orders within Fintech, then they will be allocated 40% of the tech cost.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='10'>**Fintech layer is currently not live in Efood, Talabat, HungerStation and Instashop, therefore no Tech costs are associated with these entities.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='11'>Wallet Costs </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='11'>relate to payment processing costs used to fund DH&apos;s internal wallet.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='11'>BNPL Costs</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='11'> relate to payment costs and bad debt arising from DH&apos;s internal BNPL product.The dashboard intends to provide a high level overview of the overall costs associated with each tribe, and the final computed value as a whole.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d' fontsize='11'>For a more comprehensive look at each cost, please visit the corresponding dashboard:</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='32' h='3556' id='137' is-fixed='true' name='Dash links' show-title='false' w='98770' x='615' y='81778'>
                <layout-cache fixed-size-w='200' type-h='fixed' type-w='fixed' />
