            <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='11'>Fintech Data - Payments Analytics (fintech_data_payments@deliveryhero.com)</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='11'>Update schedule: </run>
